WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.167
Ukrainian president Volodymyr

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.769
Zelensky is speaking out

00:00:02.769 --> 00:00:03.870
on the leak of highly

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.138
sensitive US

00:00:05.138 --> 00:00:06.139
intelligence

00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:07.640
that according to a new interview

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:08.942
with the Washington Post.

00:00:08.942 --> 00:00:10.143
Let's get some more on this story

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:11.611
from CNN's Nic Robertson.

00:00:11.611 --> 00:00:12.278
He's joining us

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:13.413
live from Ukraine right now.

00:00:13.413 --> 00:00:14.481
Nic, Zelinski

00:00:14.481 --> 00:00:15.515
says the disclosure

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:17.484
of this sensitive information

00:00:17.484 --> 00:00:19.452
was damaging to his country.

00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:23.123
And damaging to the United States.

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:26.292
Yeah,
he said it was bad and it doesn't reflect

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:27.460
well on the White House

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:29.162
that his biggest ally,

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:31.364
his biggest supporter,

00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:33.666
didn't contact him about leaks

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:35.668
that were emanating from their country,

00:00:35.668 --> 00:00:36.703
that affected

00:00:36.703 --> 00:00:39.272
Ukraine's national security leaks

00:00:39.272 --> 00:00:40.440
that indicated

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:42.542
or appeared to indicate that Ukraine

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:44.044
was short of ammunition

00:00:44.044 --> 00:00:44.544
leaks

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:46.112
that appeared to embarrass

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:48.281
potentially Ukrainian officials

00:00:48.281 --> 00:00:50.984
because they claimed that the

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:52.218
Ukrainian officials

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:54.320
were told not to attack

00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:57.157
Russian targets inside Russia

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:58.491
on the anniversary

00:00:58.491 --> 00:01:01.094
of the war on the 24th of February.

00:01:01.094 --> 00:01:02.529
They were talked out of that.

00:01:02.529 --> 00:01:03.363
I've spoken

00:01:03.363 --> 00:01:05.065
with defense intelligence

00:01:05.065 --> 00:01:07.367
officials here in Ukraine who say that

00:01:07.367 --> 00:01:09.002
part of the leak wasn't true.

00:01:09.002 --> 00:01:10.236
So it's not clear

00:01:10.236 --> 00:01:11.838
in the entirety of the leaks

00:01:11.838 --> 00:01:13.606
what was true, what was false,

00:01:13.606 --> 00:01:15.341
what was manipulated

00:01:15.341 --> 00:01:17.410
and the leaks that were available

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:19.012
on these open sources.

00:01:19.012 --> 00:01:22.549
But the reality of a lot of the dynamic

00:01:22.549 --> 00:01:23.283
and the tensions

00:01:23.283 --> 00:01:25.318
between the president to Lansky

00:01:25.318 --> 00:01:26.920
and President Biden

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:27.720
but clear

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:29.522
he doesn't feel happy about this

00:01:29.522 --> 00:01:30.990
and is choosing

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:33.093
to speak to it in the newspaper.

00:01:33.193 --> 00:01:35.195
That is right in the city, of course,

00:01:35.195 --> 00:01:36.729
Washington, D.C., The Washington Post,

00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:38.531
a wide ranging interview, they call it.

00:01:38.531 --> 00:01:40.233
So he's choosing very carefully

00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:42.302
where where to speak out

00:01:42.302 --> 00:01:43.803
to make sure this lands on target.

00:01:43.803 --> 00:01:44.471
Of course,

00:01:44.471 --> 00:01:45.271
Secretary of State

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:46.473
Antony Blinken did

00:01:46.473 --> 00:01:47.807
call his opposite number,

00:01:47.807 --> 00:01:49.342
the foreign minister here

00:01:49.342 --> 00:01:51.578
in Ukraine in April to discuss the leaks.

00:01:51.778 --> 00:01:53.179
But this clearly

00:01:53.179 --> 00:01:54.647
seems to have fallen short

00:01:54.647 --> 00:01:57.150
of what President Zelensky expected Wolf.

00:01:57.183 --> 00:01:58.651
Yes, some of those leaks contained

00:01:58.651 --> 00:02:00.253
highly classified U.S.

00:02:00.253 --> 00:02:01.654
intelligence assessments

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:02.388
of Ukraine's

00:02:02.388 --> 00:02:04.290
capable military capabilities

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:05.191
where there was strength

00:02:05.191 --> 00:02:06.326
and where there was weakness.

00:02:06.326 --> 00:02:07.093
And the Ukrainians

00:02:07.093 --> 00:02:09.295
clearly were not happy about that leak.

00:02:09.662 --> 00:02:10.530
All this comes,

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:11.131
Nick as you know,

00:02:11.131 --> 00:02:11.664
as Ukraine

00:02:11.664 --> 00:02:12.499
is preparing

00:02:12.499 --> 00:02:13.099
to launch

00:02:13.099 --> 00:02:15.735
a major military counteroffensive.

00:02:15.902 --> 00:02:16.703
What are you hearing

00:02:19.439 --> 00:02:20.473
Yeah,
officials I

00:02:20.473 --> 00:02:23.543
talked to indicate that they there's

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:24.777
a certain amount

00:02:24.777 --> 00:02:27.881
more ammunition that they would like

00:02:28.381 --> 00:02:31.251
I think certainly defense analyst

00:02:31.251 --> 00:02:32.719
would say to you, yes, of course,

00:02:32.719 --> 00:02:33.720
they would say that

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:35.188
they would want more ammunition

00:02:35.188 --> 00:02:37.290
because they know that this offensive

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:38.091
is critical.

00:02:38.091 --> 00:02:38.758
They know that

00:02:38.758 --> 00:02:40.293
they need to have momentum.

00:02:40.293 --> 00:02:41.027
They know that

00:02:41.027 --> 00:02:42.362
they've been short of ammunition

00:02:42.362 --> 00:02:42.996
until now

00:02:42.996 --> 00:02:44.464
and they're going to have a large number

00:02:44.464 --> 00:02:45.999
of specific targets.

00:02:45.999 --> 00:02:47.233
Imagine when they do

00:02:47.233 --> 00:02:49.102
break through the lines and move forward.

00:02:49.102 --> 00:02:51.504
They're going to want to reach deeper

00:02:51.504 --> 00:02:52.772
into Russian lines

00:02:52.772 --> 00:02:54.040
to hit their ammunition

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:56.309
supplies, to hit their supply chains,

00:02:56.309 --> 00:02:57.377
to keep them,

00:02:57.377 --> 00:02:59.179
you know, to keep them on the back foot.

00:02:59.179 --> 00:03:00.413
So that would be a concern.

00:03:00.413 --> 00:03:01.214
But as the NATO's

00:03:01.214 --> 00:03:02.916
chief has said, Ukraine has.

00:03:02.916 --> 00:03:05.451
98% of the military hardware,

00:03:05.451 --> 00:03:07.754
the fighting vehicles, that it needs.

00:03:08.054 --> 00:03:09.756
But I think perhaps

00:03:09.756 --> 00:03:12.625
the greatest indicator that the that

00:03:12.659 --> 00:03:14.761
that the offensive is not quite

00:03:14.761 --> 00:03:15.461
ready has been the

00:03:15.461 --> 00:03:16.062
whether it's

00:03:16.062 --> 00:03:18.431
been really been really raining.

00:03:18.631 --> 00:03:20.800
So the ground is very wet.

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:21.201
And that's

00:03:21.201 --> 00:03:22.835
what Ukrainian officials are saying,

00:03:22.835 --> 00:03:24.604
that the conditions aren't there yet.

00:03:24.604 --> 00:03:25.071
Now, our Nic

00:03:25.071 --> 00:03:26.906
Robertson on the scene for us. Stay safe.

00:03:26.906 --> 00:03:27.907
Thank you very much.

00:03:27.907 --> 00:03:28.908
Joining us now,

00:03:28.908 --> 00:03:30.276
CNN military analyst,

00:03:30.276 --> 00:03:31.211
the former NATO

00:03:31.211 --> 00:03:32.378
supreme allied commander,

00:03:32.378 --> 00:03:34.047
retired General Wesley Clark,

00:03:34.047 --> 00:03:34.948
and the former U.S.

00:03:34.948 --> 00:03:37.350
ambassador to Ukraine, William Taylor.

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:38.418
Ambassador Taylor,

00:03:38.418 --> 00:03:39.786
first of all, what's your reaction

00:03:39.786 --> 00:03:41.821
to these latest comments from President

00:03:41.821 --> 00:03:43.656
Zelensky in The Washington Post?

00:03:43.656 --> 00:03:45.024
Did the Biden administration

00:03:45.024 --> 00:03:45.959
misstep in

00:03:45.959 --> 00:03:47.060
not giving Ukraine

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:48.628
at least a heads up

00:03:48.628 --> 00:03:50.730
about these sensitive leaks

00:03:52.765 --> 00:03:54.601
Well, Wolf, it sounds like

00:03:54.601 --> 00:03:57.437
the secretary of State, Blinken, did call

00:03:57.470 --> 00:03:58.438
his counterpart,

00:03:58.438 --> 00:04:01.007
that is Foreign Minister Kuleba

00:04:01.007 --> 00:04:02.408
right away and let him know

00:04:02.408 --> 00:04:03.710
it sounds like.

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:05.311
Deputy Secretary of State

00:04:05.311 --> 00:04:06.045
Wendy Sherman

00:04:06.045 --> 00:04:08.114
made a couple of phone calls as well.

00:04:08.114 --> 00:04:10.450
So the effort was there,

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:13.253
whether it got to President Zelensky,

00:04:13.253 --> 00:04:14.754
if not clear.

00:04:14.754 --> 00:04:16.189
But he is, of course, right.

00:04:16.189 --> 00:04:17.423
It is embarrassing.

00:04:17.423 --> 00:04:18.424
No one denies

00:04:18.424 --> 00:04:21.127
that, that it was an embarrassing leak.

00:04:22.228 --> 00:04:23.129
But the main thing,

00:04:23.129 --> 00:04:24.731
Wolf, is the importance

00:04:24.731 --> 00:04:25.865
of what you just said.

00:04:25.865 --> 00:04:27.800
That is this counter offensive.

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:29.602
That's what needs to go forward.

00:04:29.602 --> 00:04:31.804
And the trust needs to be there.

00:04:31.804 --> 00:04:33.306
I don't think this demonstrates

00:04:33.306 --> 00:04:34.607
any lack of trust.

00:04:34.607 --> 00:04:35.375
I think this is that

00:04:35.375 --> 00:04:36.709
this was a clear mistake

00:04:36.709 --> 00:04:38.244
on the part of the United States

00:04:38.244 --> 00:04:39.545
and they tried to fix it

00:04:39.545 --> 00:04:41.314
and now they just need to move forward.

00:04:41.314 --> 00:04:42.782
You know, General Clark,

00:04:42.782 --> 00:04:43.549
I want you to watch

00:04:43.549 --> 00:04:44.550
what the Pentagon press

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:45.985
secretary, Brigadier General

00:04:45.985 --> 00:04:47.820
Patrick Ryder, just told me

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:49.389
on this program. Watch this.

00:04:50.523 --> 00:04:51.557
I can't speak to whether

00:04:51.557 --> 00:04:52.392
that's true or not.

00:04:52.392 --> 00:04:54.894
I will tell you that Secretary Austin

00:04:55.528 --> 00:04:58.731
has conducted a large number of phone

00:04:58.731 --> 00:05:00.366
calls, conducted a large amount

00:05:00.366 --> 00:05:01.968
of outreach to our allies

00:05:01.968 --> 00:05:04.003
and partners around the world

00:05:04.003 --> 00:05:06.039
to discuss the matter

00:05:06.039 --> 00:05:06.973
with them, to highlight

00:05:06.973 --> 00:05:09.208
how seriously we are taking this issue

00:05:09.742 --> 00:05:10.843
to include

00:05:10.843 --> 00:05:12.178
several conversations

00:05:12.178 --> 00:05:15.148
with his Ukrainian counterpart.

00:05:15.148 --> 00:05:15.982
So, General Clark,

00:05:15.982 --> 00:05:17.383
how does the United States right now

00:05:17.383 --> 00:05:20.219
try to repair all of this

00:05:20.987 --> 00:05:22.922
Well, you know, I do think that

00:05:22.922 --> 00:05:24.891
it is a matter of strengthening

00:05:24.891 --> 00:05:27.226
the relationship between the president.

00:05:27.627 --> 00:05:28.928
I think it is, as President

00:05:28.928 --> 00:05:30.663
Zelensky said, the White House

00:05:30.663 --> 00:05:32.298
didn't tell them anything.

00:05:32.298 --> 00:05:33.333
I think a couple of phone

00:05:33.333 --> 00:05:34.567
calls will help.

00:05:34.567 --> 00:05:36.002
But, Wolf, you have to understand,

00:05:36.002 --> 00:05:38.204
there's always tension in relations

00:05:38.204 --> 00:05:39.305
between allies,

00:05:39.305 --> 00:05:41.374
and that's true in every war.

00:05:41.407 --> 00:05:43.142
It's certainly true here.

00:05:43.142 --> 00:05:44.610
The Ukrainians want more

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:45.511
than what the United States

00:05:45.511 --> 00:05:46.512
has been willing to give.

00:05:46.512 --> 00:05:47.580
And really,

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:49.782
to me, the greatest damage of the leak

00:05:49.782 --> 00:05:51.484
is the fact that it leaked

00:05:51.484 --> 00:05:52.652
that it shows

00:05:52.652 --> 00:05:54.187
that there is something in the U.S.

00:05:54.187 --> 00:05:55.655
system that's not trustworthy.

00:05:55.655 --> 00:05:57.557
So if you're the Ukrainians

00:05:57.557 --> 00:05:59.192
and you're really determined on

00:05:59.192 --> 00:06:00.793
keeping the counteroffensive

00:06:00.793 --> 00:06:01.928
that Ambassador Taylor

00:06:01.928 --> 00:06:03.563
is talking about secret,

00:06:03.563 --> 00:06:04.964
the last thing you want

00:06:04.964 --> 00:06:06.899
is a leaky intelligence system

00:06:06.899 --> 00:06:08.234
in the United States.

00:06:08.234 --> 00:06:10.036
One on 21 year old airman

00:06:10.036 --> 00:06:11.771
who has nothing to do with it

00:06:11.771 --> 00:06:13.172
gets Joe Wicks

00:06:13.172 --> 00:06:15.274
and can see all that information.

00:06:15.274 --> 00:06:17.343
That's a real indictment of us.

00:06:17.744 --> 00:06:19.379
And so I think we it's incumbent

00:06:19.379 --> 00:06:21.214
upon us to do everything we can

00:06:21.214 --> 00:06:22.081
from the White House

00:06:22.081 --> 00:06:23.449
to repair that relationship.

00:06:23.449 --> 00:06:25.151
So what does this mean? General Clark,

00:06:26.352 --> 00:06:27.186
sorry for interrupting,

00:06:27.186 --> 00:06:28.321
but what does this mean?

00:06:28.321 --> 00:06:29.055
As the U.

00:06:29.055 --> 00:06:29.522
U.

00:06:29.522 --> 00:06:30.356
As Ukraine now

00:06:30.356 --> 00:06:31.624
is preparing to launch

00:06:31.624 --> 00:06:34.327
a major military counteroffensive,

00:06:34.627 --> 00:06:36.662
presumably in the coming days,

00:06:38.598 --> 00:06:40.233
I don't think there's anything in those

00:06:40.233 --> 00:06:42.635
in the leak really about Ukraine

00:06:42.635 --> 00:06:44.771
that wasn't known to the public.

00:06:44.771 --> 00:06:46.506
Very short of artillery ammunition.

00:06:46.506 --> 00:06:48.074
Been saying it for a year.

00:06:48.074 --> 00:06:49.475
Don't have enough air defense.

00:06:49.475 --> 00:06:51.978
Been saying it for a year.

00:06:51.978 --> 00:06:53.212
Got a lot of equipment.

00:06:53.212 --> 00:06:54.580
They got it.

00:06:54.881 --> 00:06:57.016
There's nothing in there that's

00:06:57.016 --> 00:06:58.818
that is in itself

00:06:58.818 --> 00:07:00.453
that the Russians would say, oh, my God,

00:07:00.453 --> 00:07:01.053
look at this.

00:07:01.053 --> 00:07:02.221
Let's move our forces

00:07:02.221 --> 00:07:03.389
and get ready for it.

00:07:03.389 --> 00:07:04.457
That's not the kind of leak.

00:07:04.457 --> 00:07:06.692
It is what it is, is it indicates

00:07:06.692 --> 00:07:10.196
that when this counteroffensive unrolls

00:07:10.663 --> 00:07:12.198
and the United States and Ukraine

00:07:12.198 --> 00:07:14.567
are talking about sensitive issues

00:07:14.567 --> 00:07:15.535
and the need for

00:07:15.535 --> 00:07:17.036
an immediate reinforcement here,

00:07:17.036 --> 00:07:19.038
this problem there,

00:07:19.038 --> 00:07:20.606
maybe the Ukrainians can't be

00:07:20.606 --> 00:07:22.742
as candid as they would like to be.

00:07:22.742 --> 00:07:23.209
To me,

00:07:23.209 --> 00:07:25.211
that's the real threat

00:07:25.211 --> 00:07:26.946
that the leak poses.

00:07:26.946 --> 00:07:28.014
It erodes

00:07:28.014 --> 00:07:30.483
the ability of the military chiefs

00:07:30.483 --> 00:07:31.884
to talk to each other,

00:07:31.884 --> 00:07:33.986
the White House, to talk to Zelensky

00:07:33.986 --> 00:07:35.087
and so forth.

00:07:35.087 --> 00:07:36.456
That's the risk of this.

00:07:36.456 --> 00:07:38.791
And that's
what's really needs to be repaired.

00:07:39.692 --> 00:07:40.159
All right.

00:07:40.159 --> 00:07:41.861
General Clark, Ambassador Taylor,

00:07:41.861 --> 00:07:42.528
as usual,

00:07:42.528 --> 00:07:44.030
thank you very much to both of you.

